  "howToUseBody": "Pick a tool on the left and a colour at the bottom, then draw on the sheet. The square on the bottom left opens more colours, with a field for a colour code.\n\nPencil, brush and eraser draw while you drag. Line, rectangle and ellipse are drawn from where you press to where you let go; holding Shift makes straight angles, squares and circles. The paint bucket fills an area, the colour picker takes a colour from the drawing, and the stamp puts one of the Psito Nest cockatiels where you click.\n\nKeys: P pencil, B brush, E eraser, F bucket, I picker, L line, R rectangle, O ellipse, S stamp.\n\nCtrl+Z undoes and Ctrl+Y redoes. Ctrl+N starts a new drawing, Ctrl+O opens a picture and Ctrl+S saves it as PNG. Ctrl and the mouse wheel, or Ctrl+plus and Ctrl+minus, zoom; Ctrl+0 goes back to the actual size.",
  "aboutBody": "A little paint program with cockatiels. No ads, no telemetry and no account.",
  "aboutLegal": "Code under the Apache 2.0 license. Art under CC0.",
