  "helpSelection": "The selection (M) marks a rectangle. Drag from inside it to move what it holds; it stays loose until you click outside, press Escape or pick another tool, and Ctrl+Z puts it back. Ctrl+C copies, Ctrl+X cuts, Ctrl+V pastes a picture copied here or in another program, Ctrl+A selects everything and Delete clears the selection."
